# EXPORT_IMAGE — presence at the stage root tells pi-gen to emit a
# .img at the END of this stage. We also assign IMG_SUFFIX here;
# pi-gen sources this file as shell so any KEY=value sticks. Without
# this marker pi-gen would only emit images at stages that have it
# (the upstream default: stage2 = "lite" image), and we'd get a
# generic lite image plus our overlay rather than a single named
# "openMarquee Pi OS" artifact.

IMG_SUFFIX="-openmarquee"
